@startuml SEQ_04_MENGAJUKAN_PROKER
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-04: Mengajukan Proker

actor       "Admin / Asisten"  as User
boundary    "ProkerPage"       as Page
control     "ProkerController" as Ctrl
entity      "Proker"           as ModelProker

== Mengajukan Proker ==

User -> Page         : Klik tombol "Ajukan Proker"
Page --> User : response / redirect
Page -> Ctrl         : POST /proker/{id}/ajukan
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl -> ModelProker  : Query proker
ModelProker --> Ctrl : Data proker
Ctrl  -> ModelProker : update({status_pengajuan: 'diajukan'})
ModelProker --> Ctrl : Hasil proses
Ctrl  --> Page       : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Page  --> User       : Status berubah ke "Diajukan"

@enduml